You ought to know the real answers from playing. None of the above are
poisonous (except maybe violet fungus, it's so long since I have eaten
one I can't remember). The game tells you when you eat something whether
it is poisonous or not.

Regarding the original posting, I would say eat everything, and when
something bad happens to you as a result, remember not to eat that thing
again. You will learn pretty quickly what is poisonous, hallucinatory,
etc, etc.

As a general rule on early dungeon levels don't eat: kobolds, fungi,
snakes, spiders,  bats, or anything else poisonous ;-) (there are
exceptions to this rule). It's also a bad idea to eat humans or domestic
animals. Never eat old corpses.

